"""Static bilingual lesson and byte-identical downloadable original sources."""
from pathlib import Path
from html import escape
import zipfile

FILES = ('core.py','fixtures.py','demo.py','test_core.py','README-zh.md','README-en.md','WORKSHEET-zh.md','WORKSHEET-en.md','REFERENCE-zh.md','REFERENCE-en.md','SOURCES.md')

ZH = '''<section id="prepare"><h2>01 · 先看目标，不急着跑</h2><p>前置：会读列表、循环、加减乘除与概率。认识自然对数即可，不要求微积分基础。完成后应能从样本手算梯度，解释一个参数如何变化，并分清训练和冻结参数推理。零基础可先回第 01、02 章。本课没有经过试学计时。</p><p>这是 <strong>9 个可学习分数的 bigram 模型</strong>：W[前一 token][下一 token]，行列均按 A、B、C，窗口只有一个 token。不是 attention、Transformer、预训练大模型或厂商实测。它确实执行数值训练，但只学习这张小表。</p></section>
<section id="worked"><h2>02 · 五个转移，完整算一次</h2><p>原创序列 <code>A B A B A C</code> 形成 <code>A→B, B→A, A→B, B→A, A→C</code>。不是六个样本；多个独立序列之间不得拼接成伪样本。起点 W 全零，学习率 η=0.3，全批量平均损失，自然对数。</p><p>对输入 a，取该行分数 z=W[a]，先减 m=max(z)，再算 <code>p[j]=exp(z[j]-m)/Σexp(z[k]-m)</code>。这保持分布不变，避免直接 exp 大正数溢出。初始每项概率 1/3。</p><p>单样本目标 b 的交叉熵是 <code>ℓ=-ln p[b]</code>；代码用 <code>ln Σexp(z-m) - (z[b]-m)</code>，避免概率下溢后 log(0)。L 是五个 ℓ 的平均，初始 <strong>ln 3 = 1.0986122886681098</strong>。</p><p>本例导数 <code>∂ℓ/∂z[j] = p[j] - 1[j=b]</code>：先增加各候选的概率，再对正确目标减 1。A→B 的行贡献是 [1/3,-2/3,1/3]（出现两次）；A→C 是 [1/3,1/3,-2/3]（一次）；B→A 是 [-2/3,1/3,1/3]（两次）。每项累加后除以 <strong>全部 5 个样本</strong>，不是按每行样本数除。</p><pre>平均梯度 G（行/列 A,B,C）
A: [ 1/5, -1/5,     0 ]
B: [-4/15, 2/15, 2/15 ]
C: [    0,    0,     0 ]

W_new = W_old - 0.3 × G
A: [-0.06,  0.06,  0.00]
B: [ 0.08, -0.04, -0.04]
C: [ 0.00,  0.00,  0.00]</pre><p>以一个真实参数为例：W[A,B]=0−0.3×(−1/5)=0.06。A→B 目标越常见，该分数这一步越被提高。C 从未作为输入，因此 C 行梯度为零；这不表示 C 不在词表中。</p><pre>更新后 p(next|A) = [0.3135451441, 0.3535211628, 0.3329336930]
更新后 p(next|B) = [0.3605109470, 0.3197445265, 0.3197445265]
L = (-2 ln p(B|A) -2 ln p(A|B) -ln p(C|A))/5
  = 1.0439803399807872</pre><p>训练损失下降。但专门选择未参与优化的 <strong>A→A 反例</strong>，损失从 ln3 升至 <strong>1.159811928855196</strong>。它刻意无代表性，只反驳“训练改善则处处改善”，不是代表性测试集、泛化评测或模型排行榜。</p></section>
<section id="run"><h2>03 · 下载并实际运行</h2><p>Python 3.9+，仅标准库；无需安装、网络、账号、GPU、模型或 API Key。先查看下方源代码，再解压 ZIP，进入 tiny-training 目录。网站本身不执行你的 Python。</p><pre>python3 -B demo.py
python3 -B -m unittest -v</pre><p>演示只打印 JSON，参数只在内存，不保存权重；-B 避免字节码文件。检查 before、gradient、after、两种 loss 和 inference_parameters_unchanged=true；运行记录应写明 Python 版本和命令。测试覆盖所有九项有限差分、稳定损失、无修改输入、序列边界及非法值，测试通过不等于学习者掌握。</p><p>若不一致：恢复全零表、原始 TRAIN 和 η=0.3；核对先求和再按总样本平均、更新负号、自然对数。浮点约 10⁻¹⁷ 的残差不等于机制错误。不要改答案隐藏失败；放大学习率不保证下降。</p></section>
<section id="inference"><h2>04 · 冻结参数，再生成</h2><p>更新完保存 W 的副本，然后 predict 或 generate：参数必须逐项相等。predict 只读取最后一个 token，所以主例表下 A B 与 C B 的下一步分布一样。生成采用贪心策略；同分按 A/B/C 顺序选，固定最多 0..32 个新 token，A 起始生成 8 个得到 ABABABABA。没有 EOS，达到预算停止不表示内容完整。</p><p>所有输入闭合在 A/B/C；布尔/未知 token、NaN/Inf、非 3×3 表、负学习率、非整数或越界生成预算都拒绝。过大有限值导致差值溢出也拒绝。学习率 0 返回同值新表。空或单 token 序列没有转移；整个训练至少要一个。没有任意数据批量上限，使用提供的小固定数据；生成预算只限制新 token 数。</p></section>
<section id="transfer"><h2>05 · 独立迁移：先答，再展开</h2><ol><li>参数重新归零，改为 A C A C A B，η=0.3。写出五个转移、平均梯度、更新表，指出哪行未改变及原因。</li><li>回到<strong>主例更新表</strong>，比较 A B 与 C B；给出分布，并说明为何上下文变了但参数没变。</li><li>批判“训练损失下降，所以理解全部中文，能替代生产大模型”；指出缺少的证据。解释 A→A 反例为什么不是泛化测试。</li><li>解释 η=0、生成停止预算，以及把文档放进提示词为什么不是训练。</li></ol><p>先把计算、命令、实际输出与限制写进可下载的独立练习单，不要只复制参考。</p></section>'''
EN = '''<section id="prepare"><h2>01 · Know the learning target</h2><p>Prerequisites: lists, loops, arithmetic and probabilities; recognize natural logarithms, without requiring calculus. Derive a gradient from examples, explain one changing parameter, and distinguish training from frozen inference. Newcomers can return to chapters 01 and 02. Learning time has not been measured in learner trials.</p><p>This is a <strong>nine-logit bigram model</strong>: W[previous token][next token], rows and columns A/B/C, one-token context. It is not attention, a Transformer, a pretrained LLM or a vendor evaluation. Numerical training really happens, but only on this tiny table.</p></section>
<section id="worked"><h2>02 · Five transitions, one complete step</h2><p>The original sequence <code>A B A B A C</code> gives <code>A→B, B→A, A→B, B→A, A→C</code>: five samples, not six. Never create transitions between independent sequences. Start with zero W, learning rate η=0.3, full-batch mean loss and natural logarithms.</p><p>For input a, take row z=W[a], subtract m=max(z), then compute <code>p[j]=exp(z[j]-m)/Σexp(z[k]-m)</code>. This preserves probabilities while avoiding exponentiation of large positive numbers. Initially each probability is 1/3.</p><p>For target b, cross-entropy is <code>ℓ=-ln p[b]</code>. The code uses <code>ln Σexp(z-m) - (z[b]-m)</code> to avoid log(0) when probabilities underflow. L averages all five losses: initially <strong>ln 3 = 1.0986122886681098</strong>.</p><p>The derivative is <code>∂ℓ/∂z[j] = p[j] - 1[j=b]</code>: each candidate contributes its probability, then the true target subtracts one. A→B contributes [1/3,-2/3,1/3] twice; A→C contributes [1/3,1/3,-2/3] once; B→A contributes [-2/3,1/3,1/3] twice. Sum by row and divide by <strong>all five samples</strong>, not each row's count.</p><pre>Mean gradient G (rows/columns A,B,C)
A: [ 1/5, -1/5,     0 ]
B: [-4/15, 2/15, 2/15 ]
C: [    0,    0,     0 ]

W_new = W_old - 0.3 × G
A: [-0.06,  0.06,  0.00]
B: [ 0.08, -0.04, -0.04]
C: [ 0.00,  0.00,  0.00]</pre><p>One actual parameter: W[A,B]=0−0.3×(−1/5)=0.06. Repeated A→B targets push that score up on this step. No sample uses C as input, so its row gradient is zero; C still belongs to the vocabulary.</p><pre>Updated p(next|A) = [0.3135451441, 0.3535211628, 0.3329336930]
Updated p(next|B) = [0.3605109470, 0.3197445265, 0.3197445265]
L = (-2 ln p(B|A) -2 ln p(A|B) -ln p(C|A))/5
  = 1.0439803399807872</pre><p>Training loss falls. Yet the deliberately selected <strong>A→A counterexample</strong>, excluded from optimization, rises from ln3 to <strong>1.159811928855196</strong>. This nonrepresentative probe refutes “training improvement improves everything”; it is not a representative test set, generalization benchmark or model ranking.</p></section>
<section id="run"><h2>03 · Download and actually run</h2><p>Python 3.9+, standard library only; no installation, network, account, GPU, model or API key. Inspect the source below, extract the ZIP, then enter tiny-training. The website does not execute your Python.</p><pre>python3 -B demo.py
python3 -B -m unittest -v</pre><p>The demo prints JSON, computes in memory and does not save weights; -B avoids bytecode files. Check before, gradient, after, both losses and inference_parameters_unchanged=true. Record your Python version and commands. Tests cover all nine finite differences, stable loss, unchanged inputs, sequence boundaries and invalid values; passing tests does not prove learner mastery.</p><p>If results differ, reset zero weights, original TRAIN and η=0.3. Check the total-sample mean, update minus sign and natural logarithms. Floating-point residuals near 10⁻¹⁷ are normal. Do not change expected answers to conceal a failure; larger learning rates do not guarantee improvement.</p></section>
<section id="inference"><h2>04 · Freeze parameters, then generate</h2><p>Copy updated W before predict or generate; every value must remain equal. Prediction reads only the final token, so A B and C B have identical next-token distributions under the worked-example table. Generation is greedy, ties follow A/B/C order, with an integer budget of 0..32 new tokens. Starting A and adding eight produces ABABABABA. There is no EOS; stopping at the budget does not mean the content is complete.</p><p>Vocabulary is closed to A/B/C. Bool/unknown tokens, NaN/Inf, malformed 3×3 tables, negative learning rates and noninteger/out-of-range generation budgets are rejected. Finite logits whose differences overflow are rejected too. Rate 0 returns a new table with identical values. Empty/singleton sequences have no transition; training needs at least one. There is no arbitrary batch-size cap: use the supplied tiny fixture. The generation budget bounds new tokens only.</p></section>
<section id="transfer"><h2>05 · Independent transfer: attempt before revealing</h2><ol><li>Reset weights to zero. Use A C A C A B and η=0.3. List five transitions, derive the mean gradient and new table, identify the unchanged row and explain why.</li><li>Return to the <strong>worked-example updated table</strong>. Compare A B with C B; report distributions and explain why changing context does not update parameters.</li><li>Critique “Training loss fell, so it understands all Chinese and replaces a production LLM.” Identify missing evidence and why the A→A counterexample is not a generalization test.</li><li>Explain η=0, the generation stopping budget and why documents in a prompt are not training.</li></ol><p>Record calculations, commands, observed outputs and limitations in the downloadable independent worksheet before copying a reference.</p></section>'''


def render(root):
 lab=root/'learning/tiny-training'; web=root/'web'
 with zipfile.ZipFile(web/'tiny-training-lab.zip','w',zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as z:
  for name in FILES:
   info=zipfile.ZipInfo('tiny-training/'+name, (2026,11,1,0,0,0)); info.compress_type=zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED
   z.writestr(info,(lab/name).read_bytes())
 for lang,body in [('zh',ZH),('en',EN)]:
  en=lang=='en'; suffix='-en' if en else ''; title='Nine parameters: one training step' if en else '九个参数：真正训练一步'
  links=''.join(f'<li><a href="tiny-training-{name}">{escape(name)}</a> · <a href="#source-{name}">{"Read source" if en else "阅读源码"}</a></li>' for name in FILES)
  readers=''.join(f'<details id="source-{name}"><summary>{escape(name)}</summary><pre><code>{escape((lab/name).read_text())}</code></pre></details>' for name in FILES)
  ref=(lab/f'REFERENCE-{lang}.md').read_text()
  ending=('<h2>06 · Manual learning acceptance</h2><p>Without the reference: recover all five pairs and nine gradients; explain at least one update, unchanged C row, frozen parameters and the nonrepresentative counterexample; complete transfer tasks with reasons; run both commands and explain mismatches. Missing any item means return to that section, not claim mastery. No learner trials or production-model evaluation have been performed.</p>' if en else '<h2>06 · 人工学习验收</h2><p>不看参考写出五个转移与九项梯度；解释至少一个参数更新、C 行不变、冻结参数和无代表性反例；有理由地完成迁移题；运行两条命令并解释偏差。任一缺项就回到对应章节，不宣布精通。尚未进行试学或生产模型评测。</p>')
  html=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="{'en' if en else 'zh-CN'}"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"><title>{title} · ModelAtlas</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="tiny-training.css"><script src="tiny-training.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#training-main">{'Skip to lesson' if en else '跳至课程'}</a><header><a href="academy{suffix}.html#foundations">ModelAtlas · {'Chapter 01' if en else '第 01 章'}</a> / <a href="academy{suffix}.html#tokens">{'Chapter 02' if en else '第 02 章'}</a><nav aria-label="{'Language' if en else '语言'}"><a data-training-language href="tiny-training.html">中文</a> · <a data-training-language href="tiny-training-en.html">English</a></nav></header><main id="training-main"><p>LEARN → CALCULATE → RUN → EXPLAIN</p><h1>{title}</h1><p>{'Language and region are independent; this offline lab requires no regional provider service. Region is preserved in navigation only, not inferred from language.' if en else '语言与地区独立；离线实验不依赖某地区厂商服务。导航只保留明确地区参数，不从语言推断地区。'}</p><nav aria-label="{'Lesson sections' if en else '课程目录'}"><a href="#worked">{'Worked example' if en else '完整推导'}</a> · <a href="#run">{'Run' if en else '运行'}</a> · <a href="#transfer">{'Transfer' if en else '独立迁移'}</a> · <a href="#downloads">{'Downloads and source' if en else '下载与源码'}</a></nav>{body}<details id="reference"><summary>{'Reveal transfer reference after your attempt' if en else '完成作答后再展开迁移参考'}</summary><pre>{escape(ref)}</pre></details><section id="finish">{ending}</section><section id="downloads"><h2>{'Download / inspect' if en else '下载 / 检查'}</h2><p><a href="tiny-training-lab.zip" download>{'Download self-contained Python lab ZIP' if en else '下载完整 Python 实验 ZIP'}</a></p><ul>{links}</ul>{readers}</section><footer><p>{'Mechanism reference' if en else '机制来源'}: <a href="https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html">PyTorch · Optimizing Model Parameters</a> — Loss Function / Optimizer. {'Editorial check' if en else '编辑核对'}: 2026-11-01. {'Source dates' if en else '来源自述日期'}: created 2021-02-09; updated 2026-07-31; verified 2024-11-05. {'Original ABC examples; no PyTorch dependency or copied benchmark.' if en else 'ABC 例子为原创；不依赖 PyTorch，不复用其评测。'}</p><a href="academy{suffix}.html#project">{'Continue: build a document Q&A Agent →' if en else '继续：实现资料问答 Agent →'}</a></footer></main></body></html>'''
  (web/f'tiny-training{suffix}.html').write_text(html)
 for name in FILES: (web/f'tiny-training-{name}').write_bytes((lab/name).read_bytes())

if __name__=='__main__': render(Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1])
